Source:   https://physionet.org/content/mitdb/1.0.0/   (Open Access)
Licence:  Open Data Commons Attribution License v1.0
          https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/by/1-0/
Authors:  George Moody, Roger Mark.  Published 24 Feb 2005, version 1.0.0.
Content:  48 half-hour two-channel ambulatory ECG recordings from 47 subjects,
          Beth Israel Hospital, Boston, 1975 to 1979, digitised at 360 Hz.

Citations, as requested on the PhysioNet page:

  [1] Moody, G., & Mark, R. (2005). MIT-BIH Arrhythmia Database (version 1.0.0).
      PhysioNet. RRID:SCR_007345. https://doi.org/10.13026/C2F305

